WEBVTT

00:16:24.682 --> 00:16:30.518
ukoliko bismo dali 5000 dolara
za Fondaciju protiv Malarije.

00:16:30.518 --> 00:16:34.594
A to me je zaista obradovalo,

00:16:34.594 --> 00:16:38.148
jer ja sam dao više od 5000 dolara

00:16:38.148 --> 00:16:40.995
toj istoj Fondaciji

00:16:40.995 --> 00:16:45.898
i drugim efektivnim
dobrotvornim organizacijama.

00:16:45.898 --> 00:16:47.332
Dakle, ako se loše osećate

00:16:47.332 --> 00:16:51.414
jer još uvek imate dva bubrega,

00:16:51.414 --> 00:16:54.048
postoji način da to promenite.

00:16:54.048 --> 00:16:55.248
Hvala.

00:16:55.248 --> 00:17:01.402
(Aplauz)